# The repo-root .gitignore ignores `.lingxi/` at ANY depth (it is the live
# per-project state dir). The fixture trees below deliberately CONTAIN
# `workspace/.lingxi/` documents — they are the checked-in persisted-schema
# goldens (see ../serde_compat.rs), not live state — so re-include them here.
# Without this negation, `git add`/`git add -A` silently skips the fixture
# `app.json` / `design-spec.json` files and the serde_compat tests fail on
# every fresh clone.
!**/.lingxi/
